crates/bbt-mux/tests/logic.rs:563 — 20 MiB with logic stopped and unread notification queue; paginated full-history SHA-256 matches 77553a799001eccf7d30dadb0cec39fbbbf13b0aef4ab9d45303445a67441bcb, 20,971,548 raw bytes, red tail, no gap, same PID.
